  "html": "<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Coach Artie interface\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1743818354/Screenshot_2025-04-04_at_9.59.00_PM.png\" alt=\"Coach Artie interface\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/v1743818354/Screenshot_2025-04-04_at_9.59.00_PM.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/v1743818354/Screenshot_2025-04-04_at_9.59.00_PM.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1743818354/Screenshot_2025-04-04_at_9.59.00_PM.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/v1743818354/Screenshot_2025-04-04_at_9.59.00_PM.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Coach Artie interface\" width=\"3358\" height=\"1884\" style=\"--splay-rot:0.76deg;\" data-dimensions=\"3358×1884\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay aspect-video w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Coach Artie interface</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"\" id=\"coach-artie-v1-discord-studio-assistant\">Coach Artie v1: Discord Studio Assistant</h2>\n<p class=\"\">I created <a href=\"https://coachartiebot.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://coachartiebot.com\">Coach Artie</a> to serve as our Discord studio assistant. He's evolved into a powerful AI tool with persistent memory and tool usage - helping our team coordinate and manage creative workflows.</p>\n<h2 class=\"\" id=\"coach-artie-v2-production-ai-with-mcp-tools\">Coach Artie v2: Production AI with MCP Tools</h2>\n<p class=\"\">Currently in development.</p>\n<h2 class=\"\" id=\"memory--consciousness-analysis\">Memory &#x26; Consciousness Analysis</h2>\n<p class=\"\">Explores AI consciousness emergence through memory patterns with scientific rigor applied to existential questions. This research component investigates how persistent memory systems in AI assistants might lead to emergent conscious-like behaviors.</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" id=\"related-content\">Related Content</h3>\n<ul class=\"list-disc\">\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://youtube.com/@ejfox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://youtube.com/@ejfox\">The AI-Human Creative Loop: My 2025 Working Process<svg class=\"inline-block w-4 h-4 ml-1 opacity-50 dark:opacity-75 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity align-text-bottom\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M23.498 6.186a3.02 3.02 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.02 3.02 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.02 3.02 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.02 3.02 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814M9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12z\" class=\"\"></path></svg></a> - How AI assistants integrate into continuous creative workflows</li>\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://youtube.com/@ejfox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://youtube.com/@ejfox\">AI Is Our Newest Drug<svg class=\"inline-block w-4 h-4 ml-1 opacity-50 dark:opacity-75 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity align-text-bottom\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M23.498 6.186a3.02 3.02 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.02 3.02 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.02 3.02 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.02 3.02 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814M9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12z\" class=\"\"></path></svg></a> - Philosophical exploration of AI as psychoactive technology</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"\" id=\"the-showcase-site\">The showcase site</h2>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Meet Coach Artie — the showcase landing\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/coachartie-showcase/hero.png\" alt=\"Meet Coach Artie — the showcase landing\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/coachartie-showcase/hero.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/coachartie-showcase/hero.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/coachartie-showcase/hero.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/coachartie-showcase/hero.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Meet Coach Artie — the showcase landing\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1500\" style=\"--splay-rot:-2.09deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1440×1500\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay aspect-square w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Meet Coach Artie — the showcase landing</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ejfox/coachartie_showcase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://github.com/ejfox/coachartie_showcase\">The Coach Artie showcase<svg class=\"inline-block w-4 h-4 ml-1 opacity-50 dark:opacity-75 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity align-text-bottom\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385c.6.113.82-.258.82-.577c0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04c-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729c1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236c1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998c.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605c-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93c0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22c-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176c0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23c.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405c1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405c2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23c.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176c.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22c0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92c.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22c0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286c0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12\" class=\"\"></path></svg></a> is a one-page editorial site in big serif display type on black, walking through what the agent does: adapts to its environment, remembers what matters, stays cost-conscious, writes its own release notes. It lays out 28 capabilities like a magazine feature.</p>",
